      "beat_id": "BIDEA",
      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. The name of a skill is a label. The description is a headline. The body — the part after the closing triple-dash — is the contract, and the contract is the only part that runs. Two of the three skills you just heard have body instructions their descriptions do not mention. The audit that catches that is one prompt long, and it is yours to run.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 25.7,
