      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Four words before we start. SKILL.md: the file that defines one skill — a YAML frontmatter and a body, in that order. Frontmatter: the block between the two triple-dashes at the top; `name` and `description` live there, and that is what a picker shows. Body: everything after the closing triple-dash; the actual instructions Claude will follow. Install: adding a skill to your library so Claude may invoke it; nothing else asks your permission before it runs.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 27.1,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx",
